  "observations": [
    "Baseline automatic button is 94.546875 by 21; native preferred size is 100 by 20",
    "Grid bypasses DefaultIntrinsicContentInlineSize but honors OverrideIntrinsicContentInlineSize before outer BlockNode CSS constraints",
    "Existing Element::GetInnerTextWithoutUpdate already supplies rendered button labels without a layout flush",
    "Native preferred size commits after paint; existing renderer work-loop handoff schedules original intrinsic invalidation outside paint",
    "Original mutation callbacks may reenter/destroy controls; re-resolve saved control identities afterwards",
    "Standalone helpers do not enforce desktop input ownership, so button-only desktop documents exposed the missing renderer lifetime/notifier registration",
    "Retained display items can show old pictures after UI-host loss; validate native model recreation in addition to complete pixels",
    "Only the small Chromium adapter changed; NativeUI/provider/AppKit/browser binaries and public ABI retain baseline hashes"
  ]
}
